# Binaries and generated artifacts.
# -diff/-text keep the bytes out of line-based diffs and EOL normalisation.
# -linguist-detectable is the documented Linguist attribute for keeping a path
# out of language statistics; the shorter `-linguist` is not one of Linguist's
# attributes and would be a silent no-op.
*.zip    -diff -text -linguist-detectable
*.patch  -diff -text -linguist-detectable
*.pyc    -diff -text -linguist-detectable
